{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . a wintry and inviting penguin town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mingle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >. . . with a charming cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goof Around</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > . . . with immersive, physics-based VR mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > . . . fun side activities like fishing and snowball fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Indulge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > . . . in a nighttime festival filled with games and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27<i><strong> Other Features</strong></i><strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure\u2014play at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the VR fun with a third-person spectator camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing and sitting playstyles will be supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort options\u2014such as locomotion and teleportation\u2014will be available</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552090?t=1763054603","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552090?t=1763054603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552090/8cefa4d9a8d6e893cb5a91569f8b4b6196058b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763054603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552090/8cefa4d9a8d6e893cb5a91569f8b4b6196058b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763054603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family